        <briefdescription>
<para>Return the delay to apply before exporting <computeroutput>table_name</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A non-zero delay lets the exporter batch several changes that arrive within the window. Zero means export immediately.</para>
